{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;The building hereby permitted shall be removed from the site and the site restored to its former condition on or before &lt;strong&gt;5 (five)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;years&lt;/strong&gt; from the date of this permission .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development shall achieve security standards based on Secured by Design principles to the satisfaction of the local authority &amp;amp; Metropolitan Police, details of which shall be provided to the Local Planning Authority for its written approval prior to the first occupation of the approved development. All security measures applied to the approved development shall be permanently retained thereafter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A Parking Design and Management Plan should be submitted, indicating how the car parking will be designed and managed, with reference to Transport for London guidance on parking management and parking design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);&quot;&gt;Notwithstanding the details submitted with the application, prior to above ground works, full details of refuse storage shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. Prior to occupation, the approved details shall be fully implemented. Thereafter, the refuse storage shall be retained for the life of the development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:0cm;margin-right:18.75pt;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nvertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Details of all cycle storage including the design, quantum and location\r\nshall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.\r\nAll cycle storage shall be designed in accordance with the London Cycle Design\r\nStandards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 2024186/P01&amp;nbsp; Existing Arrangement - Site Plan 10/04/2024&lt;br&gt;- 2024186/P02 Temporary Building&amp;nbsp; Floor and Roof Plans and Sections 10/04/2024&lt;br&gt;- 2024186/P03 Existing Temporary Building&amp;nbsp; 29/04/2024&lt;br&gt;- 2024186/P04 Existing Temporary Modular Building 29/04/2024&lt;br&gt;- 2024186/P05 Existing Temporary Site Cabin 29/04/2024&lt;br&gt;- 2024186/PS&amp;nbsp; Existing Arrangement&amp;nbsp; - Site Plan 10/04/2024&lt;br&gt;- 2024186/B&amp;nbsp; Pre-existing Arrangement - Site Block Plan 10/04/2024&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;No other drawings or documents apply.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
